{"id":"n76411-1-7","stage":4,"title":"정사각형 · 正四边形","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76411-1-7-1","ko":"여기서 네가 그린 그림은 어느 것이니?","zh":"这里你画的画是哪一幅呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"그린","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그린","audio":"/audio/8b9236867da1c7c570bd.mp3"}},{"text":"그림은","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림은","audio":"/audio/1d6abc0ee806f397935d.mp3"}},{"text":"어느","meaning":"某","explanation":"어느：某。","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"1","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"것이니?","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseI