n":"정사각형：正四边形。","readings":[{"term":"정사각형","audio":"/audio/ba08a64eb56c15db2425.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76411","senseId":"1","lemma":"정사각형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정사각형","audio":"/audio/ba08a64eb56c15db2425.mp3"}},{"text":"모양의","meaning":"样子，形状","explanation":"모양：样子，形状；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"5","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양의","audio":"/audio/698205e32e2450870539.mp3"}},{"text":"액자에","meaning":"相框，镜框，画框","explanation":"액자：相框，镜框，画框；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"액자","audio":"/audio/ded7183e732eecbd4535.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66734","senseId":"1","lemma":"액자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"액자에","audio":"/audio/371dc068179dd8343287.mp3"}},{"text":"걸린","meaning":"被挂","explanation":"걸리다：被挂；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸린","audio":"/audio/bac9d72ba0598d97e24c.mp3"}},{"text":"그림이","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림이","audio":"/audio/342ddbc2cfa82085a895.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"그림이에요.","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림이에요","audio":"/audio/ea8884fcc3ccab02e693.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"db084e1f145d7643","term":"저쪽","zh":"那边","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3","entryId":"75761","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人远的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["저쪽"]},{"id":"fa22cdfb3221d82b","term":"끝","zh":"头，尽头，端","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3","entryId":"48072","definition":"空间上的最后地点。","pronunciation":["끋"]},{"id":"ba08a64eb56c15db","term":"정사각형","zh":"正四边形","audio":"/audio/ba08a64eb56c15db2425.mp3","entryId":"76411","definition":"四边长度和四角大小相同的四边形。","pronunciation":["정ː사가켱"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"样子，形状","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"与某物相同或相似的模样。","pronunciation":["모양"]},{"id":"ded7183e732eecbd","term":"액자","zh":"相框，镜框，画框","audio":"/audio/ded7183e732eecbd4535.mp3","entryId":"66734","definition":"装字画、照片等的框架。","pronunciation":["액짜"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"被挂","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"为了避免掉落，物体被吊挂在某处。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3cc41767182cb60f5e6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76411","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这里你画的画是哪一幅呢？","那边角落里挂在方形相框里的那幅画就是我画的。","最近